## Required software

The codes were run in R v4.0.3. The sessionInfo() with the package used and their versions are reported at the bottom of each Figures script.

## Mapping of Pre-print to Latest Version of Code and Supplement
The following shows how the pre-print supplement maps to the final Extended Data Figures. 

| Pre-print | Current |
|:-----|:-----|
| Figure 1 and S1 | Figure 1, S2, S3, and S4 |
| Figure 2 and S2  | Figure 2 and S6  |
| Figure 3 and S3  | Figure 3 and S7A-B  |
| Figure 4 and S4  | Figure 4 and S7C-D |
| Figure 5 and S5  | Figure 5, S8, and S9A-E |
| Figure 6 and S6 (and Figure 7C)  | Figure S9F-H (and Figure 6C) |
| Figure 7 and S7  | Figure 6 and S10 |

